  "about": "Agent attention nobody tracked (UntrackedActivity): the stretches the calendar and the day's review show, where a timer could have started (earlierStart, \"Start at 9:12?\"), and the work going on with no timer that the reminder to track names (ongoing). The Mac's Kit (UntrackedActivityVectorTests.swift) and the Windows app (Spindle.Activity.Tests) both run these cases; the server's UntrackedActivity.cs has the same stretch rules. Times are wall-clock times in timeZone. covered is the time entries (and proposals waiting) take. Projects and repositories are as in split-suggestions.json, linked as chosen says; zeta has no project, and ignored lists repositories on the ignore list. unlinked is minutes of attention in repositories without a project. expected is null when there is nothing to offer.",
